    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d445">

                <pb facs="0859" n="835" xml:id="pg835"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">396.1 LO/4–750: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in the United
                        Kingdom </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d445-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-04-07T19:00:00-05:00">April 7, 1950—7 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1573. Fol agreement with Fr and Brit Embs schedule May mtg: Secy arrive Paris May
                    7 for discussions May 8 Schuman; proceeding London for discussions May 9–10
                    Bevin; with Bevin and Schuman May 11, 12, 13; NAT Council mtg May 15, 16 and 17.
                    (NAT govts have been asked to confirm.) Advance party probably commencing
                    preparatory talks Apr 24 Lond. As Fr have agreed sending Advanced group Lond all
                    preparatory talks will probably be held there. You will be informed soonest
                    composition groups.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d445-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d445-f1-content">
